Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:04:48.00,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 男单决赛
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:04:48.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}兹维列夫 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs44}² {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}5-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 谢尔顿 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.64,0:00:03.84,EN,,0,0,0,,We'd like to invite our finalist, Ben Shelton,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.64,0:00:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,有请我们的亚军 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:05.28,EN,,0,0,0,,to come on stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:05.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,请他上台
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.60,EN,,0,0,0,,You've had an amazing two weeks here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,这两周你打得非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:25.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on making your first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:25.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你打进第一个大满贯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.52,0:00:27.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and certainly not your last major final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.52,0:00:27.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,而这肯定不会是最后一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:30.48,EN,,0,0,0,,We'd love to hear your thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,说说你此刻的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:31.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:45.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, first first and most importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先 最重要的一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:46.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:46.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要感谢上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:50.32,EN,,0,0,0,,My successes are a gift,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:50.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的成功是礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:51.52,EN,,0,0,0,,the failures are a gift,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:51.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,失败也是礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.52,0:00:52.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and being here playing in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.52,0:00:52.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,能站在你们面前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.72,0:00:54.00,EN,,0,0,0,,of you guys is a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.72,0:00:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,打球 也是礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:01:04.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Sasha,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:01:04.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,萨沙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.72,0:01:07.52,EN,,0,0,0,,congrats on on these two weeks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.72,0:01:07.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你这两周 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Your second Grand Slam title,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的第二个大满贯冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:11.44,EN,,0,0,0,,two in one year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:11.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,一年里拿了两个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:15.04,EN,,0,0,0,,You, you're one of the very best players
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是世界上最顶尖的球员之一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:16.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in the world, maybe the best player
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:16.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许就是今年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:17.68,EN,,0,0,0,,in the world this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,全世界最好的那一个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:19.52,EN,,0,0,0,,What you're doing is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:19.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你做到的事情不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.52,0:01:21.12,EN,,0,0,0,,The way you're serving,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.52,0:01:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:25.08,EN,,0,0,0,,the way you're moving and playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:25.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的移动和打法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:28.96,EN,,0,0,0,,You work harder than anyone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你比我认识的任何人都努力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:30.48,EN,,0,0,0,,You put more hours on the court
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在球场上花的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:31.76,EN,,0,0,0,,than anyone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:31.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,比我认识的任何人都多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:32.88,EN,,0,0,0,,You and your team
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你和你的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:34.64,EN,,0,0,0,,do things the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,用对的方式做事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.64,0:01:37.20,EN,,0,0,0,,And sincerely happy for you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.64,0:01:37.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真心为你们高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:41.16,EN,,0,0,0,,to to hold this title.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:41.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,能捧起这座奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:46.48,EN,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:46.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一天等了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:47.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to thank my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:47.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要感谢我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:52.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I have I got the best support team
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:52.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我拥有这一行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.16,0:01:53.28,EN,,0,0,0,,in the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.16,0:01:53.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,最好的后援团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:56.16,EN,,0,0,0,,you know to do this with my family by
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:56.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,能有家人在身边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.16,0:01:57.04,EN,,0,0,0,,my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.16,0:01:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,一起走到这一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:01:59.04,EN,,0,0,0,,These four guys over here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:01:59.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,这边这四个人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.04,0:02:00.32,EN,,0,0,0,,who dedicate their life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.04,0:02:00.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,把他们的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.32,0:02:02.72,EN,,0,0,0,,to my career spending time traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.32,0:02:02.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,投进了我的职业生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:04.96,EN,,0,0,0,,the world with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:04.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,陪我走遍世界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:12.16,EN,,0,0,0,,It's an unmatched level of commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,这种投入无人能比
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:13.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you guys to my squad
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:13.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们 还有我的伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:16.08,EN,,0,0,0,,over here in this corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:16.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,就坐在这个角落
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:23.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Every one of you guys are so special
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:23.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们每一个人都很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:24.56,EN,,0,0,0,,in your own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,各有各的特别
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.56,0:02:27.60,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys showed up to to support me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.56,0:02:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们来支持我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.60,0:02:29.04,EN,,0,0,0,,have showed up to support me every day
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.60,0:02:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我职业生涯的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:30.08,EN,,0,0,0,,of my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:30.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,一天都没缺席
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.08,0:02:31.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.08,0:02:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:34.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Love you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:34.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,爱你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:40.08,EN,,0,0,0,,To the USA,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:40.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,致美网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:41.44,EN,,0,0,0,,you guys have done it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:41.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们又做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.44,0:02:44.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Put put together an amazing tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.44,0:02:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,办了一届了不起的大赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:45.76,EN,,0,0,0,,My favorite tournament of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一年里最喜欢的赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:48.32,EN,,0,0,0,,the greatest tournament in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:48.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,世界上最伟大的赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.32,0:02:50.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Craig, the new CEO,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.32,0:02:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,新任首席执行官克雷格
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:53.12,EN,,0,0,0,,congratulations on the new position.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:53.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你上任
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:54.64,EN,,0,0,0,,You've changed this game in many ways
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:54.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在很多方面改变了这项运动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:55.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and you're just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:55.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,而你才刚刚开始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:56.80,EN,,0,0,0,,We're so happy to have you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,有你在我们很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:57.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and thanks for everything
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:57.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,也谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.60,0:03:01.80,EN,,0,0,0,,that you've done here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.60,0:03:01.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经为这里做的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:07.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Eric, tournament director, thank you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:07.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛事总监埃里克 也谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:10.96,EN,,0,0,0,,your guys commitment to Americans
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:10.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们对美国球员的投入
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:13.28,EN,,0,0,0,,American success running
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:13.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,对美国网球的付出
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:15.68,EN,,0,0,0,,this tournament to to to be the greatest
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:15.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,把这项赛事办成
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:17.36,EN,,0,0,0,,in the world is is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:17.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,世界第一 难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:19.44,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you all everyone at the USA.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:19.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢美网的每一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:19.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I want
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:23.60,EN,,0,0,0,,to thank the sponsors all the sponsors
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:23.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有赞助商
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:25.44,EN,,0,0,0,,for making this tournament possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,是他们让这项赛事办得起来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:28.96,EN,,0,0,0,,all the volunteers, the drivers, my driver,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有志愿者 司机们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:31.52,EN,,0,0,0,,my driver Xavier is up there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:31.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的司机泽维尔就在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:34.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you X.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:34.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 X
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:36.08,EN,,0,0,0,,You're the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:36.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,你最棒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.08,0:03:42.32,EN,,0,0,0,,To the umpires, ball kids, everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.08,0:03:42.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有裁判 球童
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:44.48,EN,,0,0,0,,at the practice desk, all the security guards
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:44.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,练习场的工作人员 保安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:46.08,EN,,0,0,0,,who make me smile every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们每天都让我微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:48.56,EN,,0,0,0,,This this is is my happy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:48.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里是让我开心的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:51.12,EN,,0,0,0,,This is the place that I I love to spend time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢待在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:52.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and I wish this tournament never ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,真希望这项赛事永远不结束
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:56.28,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:03.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to thank my sponsors,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:03.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要感谢我的赞助商
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:04.80,EN,,0,0,0,,everyone behind the scenes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有幕后的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:07.20,EN,,0,0,0,,who supported me along the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:07.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,一路支持我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:08.64,EN,,0,0,0,,believed in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:08.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,相信我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.16,EN,,0,0,0,,We still have a long way to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们还有很长的路要走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:11.92,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm very appreciative of everyone who's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:11.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我非常感激
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:13.36,EN,,0,0,0,,had my back from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:13.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,从一开始就挺我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.36,0:04:17.12,EN,,0,0,0,,And lastly, to the city of New York,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.36,0:04:17.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后 致纽约这座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:26.16,EN,,0,0,0,,to the to the fans who showed up today,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:26.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,致今天到场的球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:27.52,EN,,0,0,0,,the fans at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:27.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,屏幕前的球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.52,0:04:28.88,EN,,0,0,0,,the people who've been here all week,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.52,0:04:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一整周都在这儿的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.88,0:04:31.28,EN,,0,0,0,,the people who stayed till 4 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.88,0:04:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有熬到凌晨四点的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:36.00,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys drove me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:36.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,是你们推着我往前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:37.84,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys brought me to the place
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:37.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,是你们把我带到今天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:39.60,EN,,0,0,0,,that I'm here today, the position
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:39.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,带到我想要的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:41.92,EN,,0,0,0,,that I want to be in in the finals
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:41.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,站在这些大赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:43.20,EN,,0,0,0,,of these tournaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,决赛的赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:44.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm just getting started
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:44.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我才刚刚开始
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.72,0:04:45.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'll be back here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.72,0:04:45.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还会回到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:47.82,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:47.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢大家
